      {
        "name": "places/ChIJd04KSwAJBDQRQexTJ6LgfZY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xcVZtbEJRazlYY0V0VVRrbDBVbkY2TjJaeWFtYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": {
          "text": "店員很友善，奶昔機也很酷。但是庫存太不穩定，我需要的東西總是缺貨。我覺得可能是其他Yata分店的剩餘商品都運到這裡來了。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The staff are nice and the smoothie machine is cool. The inventory is too inconsistent and things are always out of stock when I need them. I think the leftover items from other Yata branches end up here.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Michael",
