      {
        "name": "places/ChIJd04KSwAJBDQRQexTJ6LgfZY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sbE9UQmFSWGRPWjJSSVVqSlVWMXByZW1weU9WRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "能找到一家不設停車場也不擁擠的商店真是太好了。這裡有各種各樣的日本食品和零食，種類繁多，非常豐富，而且店面整潔舒適，購物體驗很棒，我很喜歡。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "It’s just so nice you have something that is not parking shop or welcome. There is a distance selection of Japanese food and snacks and so for real pretty interesting and the story is tidy pretty comfortable to shop at love it",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
